## 顶层连线

在模块顶层例化 tree interface

```systemverilog
module your_top_module;
    ...
    {{ settings.class_prefix }}tree_interface clk_tree_if();
    ...
endmodule
```

tree 构建时传入该 interface 实例

```systemverilog
function void build_phase(uvm_phase phase);
    ...
    tree.build(your_top_module.clk_tree_if{% if regs_enabled %}, your_regmodel{% endif %});
endfunction
```

{% endif %}
